            "review_title": "Review at Pho 24",
            "review_text": "Raymondale\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia1361 contributions\n0\na chain restaurant\nNov 2023 • Solo\ni first had pho at pho 24 in 2017 ,last year when i had a nine days trip to HCM, on 27 Nov night,i decided to have pho at pho 24 again, i searched from internet, and chose Pasteur store.there are many stores in the city, it is a famous chain restaurant in HCM. i ordered pho special combo regular size comes with kumquat drinks, also ordered a banh flan (pudding). pho is quite ok, not bad, but pudding less impressive. the dining place at this store is good, the place not small, cozy and relaxing.if you don't know where to eat pho, maybe you can try pho 24.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 28, 2024",
