            "review_text": "Jace Ogan\nTucson, Arizona380 contributions\n0\nDelicious Pho for under $5\nOct 2019 • Solo\nNot a whole lot of choices, especially if you’re looking for seafood. If ya like a variety of beef and some damn good broth, you’ve come to the right place! I went twice during my visit to Saigon. Both visits were under $5 for pho, spring rolls, and a soda. Try the beef meatballs and the brisket. Service is quick, as you pay up front, then take your number to a table. Sit, eat, enjoy!\nRead more\nWritten October 31, 2019",
